# Rolling text: the VERT_DRIVE Trace from UD8 to the monitor connector J7 (pad 3, an end of the Trace) is cracked; the monitor gets no vertical drive and never locks.
machine bw2001
title "Rolling text"
brief "The BW-2001's text is there, but the picture will not hold still: it drifts up the screen and never settles."
fault crack J7.VDRIVE UD8.4Y 50%
